WEBVTT

00:00:09.050 --> 00:00:11.100
Hey, what are we going to do with the child?

00:00:11.310 --> 00:00:12.930
Someone will have to take him in.

00:00:13.140 --> 00:00:15.690
There's no way I can. We have a lot of children.

00:00:15.890 --> 00:00:16.810
Me, too.

00:00:17.020 --> 00:00:18.190
Isn't there anyone?

00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:19.310
Someone...

00:00:19.520 --> 00:00:21.520
Well...

00:00:21.730 --> 00:00:24.990
What the hell? Is “someone, someone“
all you people can say?

00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:27.280
Hey, it'd be impossible for you.

00:00:27.490 --> 00:00:30.370
It's not impossible. I'm the kid's uncle.

00:00:31.950 --> 00:00:33.450
Mahiru.

00:00:35.830 --> 00:00:39.750
Thinking simply, it's gotta be me.

00:02:16.640 --> 00:02:19.100
Shirota Mahiru, 15 years old.

00:02:20.140 --> 00:02:23.610
I love simple things. I hate troublesome things.

00:02:29.780 --> 00:02:31.950
That's why I picked him up.

00:02:32.160 --> 00:02:36.330
It's really troublesome to
do nothing and regret it later.

00:02:38.830 --> 00:02:43.040
Perfect! I'll name you Kuro.

00:02:43.250 --> 00:02:48.460
I didn't know keeping him would put
my life in danger until the next day.

00:02:54.050 --> 00:02:59.560
Um, all that's left is deciding
who is in charge of the costumes.

00:02:59.770 --> 00:03:01.890
What? I definitely can't do anything like sewing.

00:03:04.730 --> 00:03:06.560
Hey! Hey! What about Mahiru? Mahiru!

00:03:06.770 --> 00:03:09.280
Mahiru was chosen to be
in charge of food prep.

00:03:09.480 --> 00:03:12.360
But, he lives alone and can do
all kinds of housework perfectly.

00:03:12.570 --> 00:03:15.030
Well, that's true, but...

00:03:15.240 --> 00:03:18.450
What a pain! How long does it take
to decide who does what?!

00:03:18.660 --> 00:03:20.160
--Mahiru!
--Here.

00:03:20.370 --> 00:03:23.000
I baked some test cookies
while you guys were deciding.

00:03:25.130 --> 00:03:27.710
G-Get in line! I have enough for everyone!

00:03:27.920 --> 00:03:29.880
Delicious!

00:03:30.090 --> 00:03:32.590
Even though it's a super simple butter cookie...

00:03:32.800 --> 00:03:34.180
Is he a pro or something?!

00:03:34.380 --> 00:03:36.140
Simple is best!

00:03:37.140 --> 00:03:39.310
Costumes are all that's left?

00:03:39.510 --> 00:03:40.720
The one in charge of costumes

00:03:40.930 --> 00:03:43.640
should know how to sew and have free time...

00:03:43.850 --> 00:03:46.310
Thinking simply, it's gotta be me!

00:03:46.520 --> 00:03:48.820
--Yay!
--There it is!

00:03:52.610 --> 00:03:56.260
Mahiru! Will you be all right,
taking on that much?

00:03:56.270 --> 00:03:57.920
Last time, too.

00:03:58.300 --> 00:03:59.750
A relay race participant?

00:04:00.120 --> 00:04:01.950
Someone with fast feet,
but not from the track club...

00:04:02.160 --> 00:04:03.910
Thinking simply, it's gotta be me!

00:04:04.120 --> 00:04:05.750
--Yay!
--There it is!

00:04:06.370 --> 00:04:07.290
Taking care of the class rabbit?

00:04:07.500 --> 00:04:09.670
--It's gotta be me!
--Yay! --There it is!

00:04:09.880 --> 00:04:13.630
Well, someone has to do it,
so it's troublesome to fight over it.

00:04:13.840 --> 00:04:17.430
But isn't it hard sometimes to do it
all by yourself, Mahiru-sama?

00:04:17.640 --> 00:04:20.260
Should I help, as your childhood friend?

00:04:20.470 --> 00:04:21.850
Though I can't even thread a needle.

00:04:22.060 --> 00:04:24.560
That would cause me more trouble!
I'm fine on my own.

00:04:25.600 --> 00:04:26.730
Hey, Mahiru.

00:04:26.940 --> 00:04:28.860
I've always wanted to ask...

00:04:29.060 --> 00:04:29.860
Huh?

00:04:30.060 --> 00:04:32.320
Why are you like that?

00:04:32.530 --> 00:04:33.490
Like what?

00:04:33.690 --> 00:04:36.990
Well, don't you always take on
jobs others don't want to do?

00:04:37.200 --> 00:04:40.120
It's like I always say. It's too troublesome.

00:04:40.330 --> 00:04:42.330
What? Isn't it normally the opposite?

00:04:42.540 --> 00:04:46.290
No one wants to do them
because it would be a pain.

00:04:46.500 --> 00:04:50.500
Well, how should I say this?
It's how you look at it?

00:04:50.710 --> 00:04:51.920
You're weird.

00:04:52.130 --> 00:04:56.470
Well, everyone ends up taking the
easy way out and leaving it to you.

00:04:56.670 --> 00:04:59.680
Well, um, sorry for that.

00:04:59.890 --> 00:05:00.850
Ryusei...

00:05:01.050 --> 00:05:04.060
So please tell us if there's
something that we can do.

00:05:04.270 --> 00:05:05.060
Koyuki...

00:05:05.270 --> 00:05:06.600
Me, too! Me, too!

00:05:06.810 --> 00:05:08.100
Will you be of any use?

00:05:08.310 --> 00:05:10.650
Hey! That's so mean!

00:05:11.650 --> 00:05:14.110
For now, we'll at least
come along for the shopping.

00:05:14.320 --> 00:05:15.280
--Yeah.
--Oh!

00:05:15.490 --> 00:05:16.990
What is it, Sakuya?

00:05:17.200 --> 00:05:19.030
You're gonna shop in front of the station, right?

00:05:19.240 --> 00:05:20.370
Yeah, probably.

00:05:20.570 --> 00:05:21.620
Be careful.

00:05:21.820 --> 00:05:25.450
Lately, vampires have been
appearing in that area!

00:05:25.660 --> 00:05:28.000
That's the rumor.

00:05:29.000 --> 00:05:30.710
Huh?

00:05:29.000 --> 00:05:30.710
No, seriously!

00:05:30.920 --> 00:05:32.500
It's like a street slasher or something.

00:05:32.710 --> 00:05:35.000
The victims had bite marks
on their necks or arms,

00:05:35.210 --> 00:05:37.670
and all of their blood was sucked dry!

00:05:37.880 --> 00:05:40.390
I heard there were already over ten victims.

00:05:40.590 --> 00:05:42.260
What? That's scary!

00:05:42.470 --> 00:05:45.220
Now, I wonder how much
of that story was a lie?

00:05:45.430 --> 00:05:47.560
--Ouch!
--I thought you'd say that!

00:05:47.770 --> 00:05:50.900
Your stories about rumors are usually lies!

00:05:51.100 --> 00:05:53.400
So that was all a lie? Oh!

00:05:53.610 --> 00:05:56.230
Want to go sing karaoke in front
of the station? I have a coupon!

00:05:56.440 --> 00:05:57.940
Completely ignored!

00:05:59.150 --> 00:06:03.370
Well, I'm going to go home
and take in the laundry first.

00:06:03.580 --> 00:06:05.290
Hey! Listen to me!

00:06:05.490 --> 00:06:07.200
Don't blame me if you get attacked!

00:06:07.410 --> 00:06:08.910
Yeah. Yeah.

00:06:10.370 --> 00:06:15.420
“There are vampires.“ I knew that
rumor was currently going around.

00:06:17.960 --> 00:06:21.800
That's right, Kuro. I wonder if he's being good?

00:06:22.010 --> 00:06:25.970
Today's gourmet spot is a hidden
little secret in the shopping district...

00:06:26.180 --> 00:06:29.770
I'm home... Wait, huh?

00:06:29.980 --> 00:06:32.770
Did I leave the TV on?

00:06:49.040 --> 00:06:51.000
Huh? What is this?

00:06:53.540 --> 00:06:55.840
W-Who...?!

00:06:57.960 --> 00:07:01.550
Ah. This has gotten so troublesome I could die.

00:07:01.760 --> 00:07:05.390
Who the hell are you?! What are you
doing in another person's house?

00:07:10.430 --> 00:07:12.690
What a violent kid.

00:07:12.890 --> 00:07:15.770
So scary. I can't face you.

00:07:17.770 --> 00:07:19.280
Ow...

00:07:22.240 --> 00:07:24.660
Huh? Kuro?

00:07:26.280 --> 00:07:27.740
What are you doing?

00:07:27.950 --> 00:07:30.750
I can't face the light at all.

00:07:31.910 --> 00:07:34.120
W-What in the world are you?!

00:07:34.330 --> 00:07:36.250
What am I?

00:07:36.460 --> 00:07:41.880
Just a kindhearted, vampire shut-in...

00:07:45.220 --> 00:07:46.840
I'll toss you outside my window!

00:07:47.050 --> 00:07:49.930
Wait! I'm a vampire.
Don't throw me out in the sun.

00:07:50.140 --> 00:07:53.350
I'll die! I'll die! I'm immortal, but I'll die!

00:07:53.560 --> 00:07:55.980
Humans are such cruel creatures.

00:07:56.190 --> 00:07:58.310
Shut up, you evil spirit!

00:07:58.520 --> 00:08:02.400
Vampire...? Are you that street slasher?!

00:08:02.610 --> 00:08:04.200
Are you planning to attack me
and drink my blood?!

00:08:04.400 --> 00:08:08.240
Huh? Why would I do something
so troublesome I could die?

00:08:08.450 --> 00:08:10.790
Have you been told you're
way too self-conscious?

00:08:10.990 --> 00:08:11.950
Who'd attack someone like you?

00:08:12.160 --> 00:08:13.750
You should attack! You're a vampire!

00:08:13.960 --> 00:08:16.960
Don't say that so easily. Doing that's a crime!

00:08:17.170 --> 00:08:19.920
Putting that aside, I'm thirsty.
Can you make me some tea?

00:08:20.130 --> 00:08:22.510
Argh! I don't know where I should start!

00:08:22.710 --> 00:08:24.510
Well, don't get so angry.

00:08:24.720 --> 00:08:26.930
I'll leave once it gets dark.

00:08:27.140 --> 00:08:30.100
For now, don't say my name
while I'm in human form.

00:08:30.300 --> 00:08:33.810
Huh?! I-I don't know what your name is!

00:08:34.020 --> 00:08:36.730
I thought you were a cat,
so I called you "Kuro"...

00:08:50.910 --> 00:08:52.370
You're so stupid I could die.

00:08:52.580 --> 00:08:53.490
What the hell was that just now?!

00:08:53.700 --> 00:08:56.580
--What a pain.
--Stop being so lazy and explain!

00:08:56.790 --> 00:08:58.120
Explaining is such a pain.

00:08:58.330 --> 00:09:01.340
Do it now! And do it simply!

00:09:01.540 --> 00:09:04.880
You have so many complaints.

00:09:05.090 --> 00:09:09.140
Well, at the very least, I can tell you this.

00:09:09.340 --> 00:09:11.390
You and I would die before getting along.

00:09:11.600 --> 00:09:14.430
That's funny, I was just thinking the <i>same</i> thing!

00:09:17.190 --> 00:09:19.560
A vampire that specializes in being cared for?

00:09:20.560 --> 00:09:22.270
Well, how should I say this?

00:09:22.480 --> 00:09:25.610
They only drink blood from
the master they contract with.

00:09:25.820 --> 00:09:29.410
And their master's orders
are troublesome, but they listen.

00:09:29.610 --> 00:09:35.040
We have a name, too, but there's
no point in telling you.

00:09:35.410 --> 00:09:37.650
I don't really get it,
but don't roll around like that!

00:09:38.540 --> 00:09:42.630
It can't be that the thing that
just happened was a contract...

00:09:42.840 --> 00:09:45.840
No, that was just a temporary contract.

00:09:46.050 --> 00:09:47.590
Temporary contract?

00:09:47.800 --> 00:09:51.590
As long as I don't drink your
blood in the next 24 hours,

00:09:51.800 --> 00:09:53.680
it'll automatically get canceled.

00:09:55.390 --> 00:09:59.100
24 hours? Then...

00:09:59.310 --> 00:10:01.650
...hurry up and go wherever you want.

00:10:08.610 --> 00:10:09.820
There you go.

00:10:10.030 --> 00:10:11.780
Until the contract is canceled,

00:10:11.990 --> 00:10:15.330
you and I can only be a certain distance apart.

00:10:15.540 --> 00:10:18.290
I have to be with a guy like this for 24 hours?

00:10:18.500 --> 00:10:21.580
Right back at you!

00:10:21.790 --> 00:10:24.960
Argh! Don't spill potato chip crumbs!

00:10:28.800 --> 00:10:30.880
You're so abusive towards cute pets!

00:10:31.090 --> 00:10:33.760
I'd like to see your parents' faces!

00:10:33.970 --> 00:10:35.850
Come to think of it, where are your parents?

00:10:39.180 --> 00:10:40.690
My mom...

00:10:42.600 --> 00:10:45.520
...died a long time ago in an accident.

00:10:45.730 --> 00:10:50.320
I was alone and my relatives didn't
reall know where to send me... y

00:10:51.360 --> 00:10:53.530
...but my uncle took me in.

00:10:57.030 --> 00:11:00.620
If my uncle wasn't there,
I would have probably...

00:11:01.960 --> 00:11:07.460
Oh, that's why you felt sorry
and picked up a dirty cat like me.

00:11:07.670 --> 00:11:11.220
You're so stupid.
It's gotten so troublesome now.

00:11:11.420 --> 00:11:13.590
The source of my troubles shouldn't talk!

00:11:13.800 --> 00:11:15.800
Oh, that's right. I have to go out.

00:11:16.010 --> 00:11:18.310
No way. No way. Turn them down.

00:11:18.510 --> 00:11:20.730
We can't separate more than a certain distance.

00:11:20.930 --> 00:11:22.180
Then you should just come, too!

00:11:22.390 --> 00:11:25.900
Stop! I can't face the sunlight!

00:11:26.110 --> 00:11:28.270
It's getting dark, so you'll be fine!

00:11:50.000 --> 00:11:51.710
This cat?

00:11:51.920 --> 00:11:53.010
A vampire?

00:11:53.220 --> 00:11:55.340
Like I said, it's just like Sakuya said!

00:11:55.550 --> 00:11:57.220
That rumor about vampires!

00:11:57.430 --> 00:11:58.850
This thing is really an evil spirit.

00:11:59.060 --> 00:12:01.100
Argh! Why isn't Sakuya here?!

00:12:01.310 --> 00:12:02.810
He'd totally be all over this!

00:12:03.020 --> 00:12:04.980
Um, Mahiru?

00:12:05.190 --> 00:12:07.190
You know, that's a cat.

00:12:07.400 --> 00:12:11.690
No! He turns into a human!
Kuro! Turn into a human!

00:12:11.900 --> 00:12:13.320
Don't stay silent like that!

00:12:13.530 --> 00:12:15.320
--Mahiru...
--Huh?

00:12:15.530 --> 00:12:16.700
Are you tired?

00:12:16.910 --> 00:12:18.240
Don't handle all of your problems alone.

00:12:18.450 --> 00:12:23.160
No! Um, how should I explain this...

00:12:27.170 --> 00:12:28.920
Hello! Hello!

00:12:29.130 --> 00:12:32.250
Students! If you're going to go
down the worthless path of youth,

00:12:32.460 --> 00:12:35.010
why not stop to see my show?

00:12:35.220 --> 00:12:38.550
Thank you! Thank you!
Thank you for the applause!

00:12:38.760 --> 00:12:42.010
Amazing! Magic? A street performance?!

00:12:38.760 --> 00:12:42.010
Huh?!

00:12:42.220 --> 00:12:45.060
Forget about something
like magic tricks. Let's go.

00:12:46.060 --> 00:12:46.940
Hey, you!

00:12:47.140 --> 00:12:50.190
Now, here's a question for you!

00:12:47.140 --> 00:12:50.190
Huh? What is it?

00:12:50.400 --> 00:12:54.110
Why do you think I stopped this guy?

00:12:54.320 --> 00:12:55.490
Huh?

00:13:06.750 --> 00:13:08.920
The answer is...

00:13:14.170 --> 00:13:19.970
All of the above! Die, idiot!
I'll kill you if you ignore me!

00:13:20.180 --> 00:13:21.720
--Ryusei!
--Ryu-chan!

00:13:26.640 --> 00:13:29.850
Thank you! Thank you!
Thanks for all your cheers!

00:13:35.110 --> 00:13:38.950
The crowd always gets more excited
about this than they do magic!

00:13:39.990 --> 00:13:44.040
That's because vampires are
rarer than magicians, right?

00:13:44.240 --> 00:13:45.870
Vampire?!

00:13:46.080 --> 00:13:50.080
That's right! You picked one up
yesterday, didn't you?

00:13:50.290 --> 00:13:53.460
Who the hell are you?

00:13:54.880 --> 00:13:56.460
Kuro's friend?

00:13:58.970 --> 00:14:06.180
The opposite! I hate that little black cat!

00:14:07.640 --> 00:14:10.480
That's why I'll skewer you if you protect him.

00:14:10.690 --> 00:14:12.440
Now, then! Some applause!

00:14:12.650 --> 00:14:15.570
Come on out, Sleepy Ash!

00:14:15.780 --> 00:14:17.900
Like a vampire should, with bravado!

00:14:18.110 --> 00:14:22.070
Let's kill a lot and compete!

00:14:22.280 --> 00:14:25.080
He wishes for that as well!

00:14:26.540 --> 00:14:29.290
Kuro! What's going on here?

00:14:29.500 --> 00:14:32.170
For now, let's run!

00:14:32.370 --> 00:14:34.630
Huh? W-Wait! Kuro!

00:14:34.840 --> 00:14:35.880
It's seriously bad! So much blood!

00:14:36.090 --> 00:14:39.920
That's right! Right in front of me...

00:14:40.130 --> 00:14:42.510
Why are you running away?!

00:14:42.720 --> 00:14:45.100
Let me go!

00:14:45.300 --> 00:14:49.270
I can't face a crazy vampire
like that. We have to run.

00:14:49.480 --> 00:14:52.770
You're a vampire, too!
You're the only one who can face him!

00:14:52.980 --> 00:14:54.860
I don't know a guy like that.

00:14:55.060 --> 00:14:57.570
He's got nothing to do with me.

00:14:57.780 --> 00:14:59.280
My friend was attacked!

00:14:59.490 --> 00:15:01.950
If I leave that guy alone,
everyone will be killed!

00:15:02.150 --> 00:15:04.450
Someone has to stop him!

00:15:04.660 --> 00:15:06.870
What a pain.

00:15:07.080 --> 00:15:08.620
“I can't do anything."

00:15:08.830 --> 00:15:11.160
“I don't have any power.“

00:15:11.370 --> 00:15:13.540
"Someone do something about this.“

00:15:13.750 --> 00:15:15.840
“Someone." “Someone."

00:15:16.040 --> 00:15:20.710
Everyone says it, and I'd rather do that.

00:15:25.590 --> 00:15:28.180
Where did you go?!

00:15:28.390 --> 00:15:30.180
I want to gather more attention!

00:15:30.390 --> 00:15:32.520
<i>Ryu</i>-<i>Chan! Ryu</i>-<i>Chan!</i>

00:15:32.730 --> 00:15:34.900
Oh, is that thing still alive?

00:15:36.610 --> 00:15:40.480
Then, run away on your own!

00:15:43.860 --> 00:15:48.990
That's what he gets for ignoring me!

00:15:49.200 --> 00:15:51.330
Save us, someone...

00:15:56.330 --> 00:15:59.210
“Someone." “Someone."

00:15:59.420 --> 00:16:01.760
Everyone always thinks that.

00:16:01.960 --> 00:16:07.010
Because it's easier. Because you
can't do anything about it.

00:16:07.220 --> 00:16:13.980
But the world keeps going
because that someone appears.

00:16:15.480 --> 00:16:16.350
Mahiru!

00:16:16.560 --> 00:16:18.900
Take Ryusei and run!

00:16:19.110 --> 00:16:22.150
I wanted to become that “someone" too.

00:16:22.360 --> 00:16:25.320
If you try to show off too much...

00:16:25.530 --> 00:16:27.740
...I'll kill you!

00:16:27.950 --> 00:16:34.000
People like you are the most troublesome.

00:16:37.750 --> 00:16:40.380
You're such a pain, I could die!

00:16:44.220 --> 00:16:46.760
Just what do you think that you or I can do?!

00:16:46.970 --> 00:16:50.600
I haven't drunk any blood
for hundreds of years!

00:16:50.800 --> 00:16:54.890
I'm practically a normal cat.

00:16:55.100 --> 00:16:56.560
<i>Kuro</i>

00:16:56.770 --> 00:17:01.770
Run. Though I don't think
I can do much by myself.

00:17:01.980 --> 00:17:05.610
I don't think I can do this by myself.

00:17:05.820 --> 00:17:11.620
I'll try my best. So you try your
best, too. How's that, Mahiru?

00:17:13.490 --> 00:17:20.170
Oh, it's so simple.
That “someone" isn't me right now.

00:17:20.380 --> 00:17:21.840
It isn't you, either.

00:17:22.040 --> 00:17:25.460
That's because it's probably us.

00:17:27.300 --> 00:17:30.300
Let's do something about it together, Kuro!

00:17:36.850 --> 00:17:42.060
People like you are the most troublesome.

00:17:43.360 --> 00:17:45.650
Shirota Mahiru, 15 years old.

00:17:45.860 --> 00:17:49.860
I love simple things. I hate troublesome things.

00:17:50.070 --> 00:17:51.990
That's why I picked up a cat.

00:17:52.200 --> 00:17:54.910
Well, it should have been a cat...

00:17:56.790 --> 00:18:00.370
Well, it can't be helped. You're my Eve now.

00:18:00.580 --> 00:18:01.920
This is a problem.

00:18:02.130 --> 00:18:04.250
He made a contract!

00:18:04.460 --> 00:18:08.170
True vampires that make contracts
with humans have a name.

00:18:13.680 --> 00:18:15.180
Meow.

00:18:16.470 --> 00:18:21.230
The pet I decided to keep
ended up being a vampire.

00:18:21.440 --> 00:18:23.610
So, what should we do?

00:18:29.400 --> 00:18:30.200
We'll defeat him!

00:18:30.400 --> 00:18:35.830
You read too much <i>shonen</i> manga.
I don't want to face him...

00:18:42.920 --> 00:18:46.420
Servamps move according
to their master's orders.

00:18:46.630 --> 00:18:53.510
So I take no responsibility
for my actions from now on.

00:19:12.990 --> 00:19:16.580
Kuro. Kuro! That's enough.

00:19:16.780 --> 00:19:20.580
That's enough! He can't move anymore...

00:19:24.420 --> 00:19:28.380
You told me that I have to
take all responsibility, right?

00:19:28.590 --> 00:19:30.960
Then listen to me!

00:19:37.430 --> 00:19:40.140
You shit! You shit, you shit, you shit!

00:19:40.350 --> 00:19:44.350
The fun and exciting vampire parade to hell!

00:19:44.560 --> 00:19:48.520
It's a runaway train with no stops
in between, you shitty brat!

00:19:49.530 --> 00:19:53.110
Then, we'll end the show here for today!

00:19:57.410 --> 00:19:59.870
W-What the hell?

00:20:02.160 --> 00:20:04.710
Did he die?

00:20:06.670 --> 00:20:08.630
Of course I didn't! I'm a vampire!

00:20:08.840 --> 00:20:10.800
Stupid! Stupid!

00:20:12.460 --> 00:20:15.930
Stop! Don't shake me!

00:20:16.140 --> 00:20:20.470
Why did you attack another vampire like Kuro?

00:20:20.680 --> 00:20:22.770
It was my errand!

00:20:22.980 --> 00:20:24.310
Errand?

00:20:24.520 --> 00:20:27.310
I have a master, too.

00:20:27.520 --> 00:20:34.190
His name is Tsubaki and he hates Sloth!

00:20:34.400 --> 00:20:37.660
I don't know this Tsubaki guy, though.

00:20:37.870 --> 00:20:40.870
That's right. You don't know Tsubaki.

00:20:41.080 --> 00:20:44.250
Poor Tsubaki. Poor Tsubaki.

00:20:44.460 --> 00:20:47.040
No one knows Tsubaki!

00:20:47.250 --> 00:20:50.420
That's why Tsubaki wants to kill!

00:20:50.630 --> 00:20:53.840
His siblings, humans, society, and the world!

00:20:54.050 --> 00:20:58.220
He wants everyone who
doesn't know him to die.

00:20:58.430 --> 00:21:00.850
What I don't know, I don't know.

00:21:01.050 --> 00:21:02.560
What a pain...

00:21:05.060 --> 00:21:09.980
The chains disappeared. That surprised me.

00:21:10.190 --> 00:21:12.400
Hey, are you all right, Kuro?!

00:21:12.610 --> 00:21:14.190
I'm not all right at all.

00:21:14.400 --> 00:21:16.900
I'm definitely going to
be sore all over tomorrow!

00:21:17.110 --> 00:21:20.030
--What a pain...
--You get sore muscles?

00:21:21.780 --> 00:21:23.410
But thank goodness.

00:21:23.620 --> 00:21:29.540
He was a little scary just now,
but he's back to normal.

00:21:31.130 --> 00:21:35.590
Huh? My consciousness...

00:21:35.800 --> 00:21:39.470
Someone explain this in simple terms to me...

00:22:04.370 --> 00:22:06.120
Not interesting at all.

00:23:42.050 --> 00:23:42.260
Who'd be soothed by you?!
